    "_srcBlendFactor": 770,
    "_dstBlendFactor": 771,
    "_string": "We are committed to creating an online platform for Texas Hold 'em fans \n\nto play and improve their skills at Poker Queen.\n\nWe have various kinds of popular gameplay:\n\nNLH - Classic regular Texas Hold’em.\n\nPLO-From four to six card Pot-limit Omaha Poker game.\n\n6+ Short deck - a whole new poker game.\n\nWe also have a built-in community chat page for social gameplay, \n\nallowing you to chat with other players while playing the game. Poker \n\nQueen brings us closer and invites you to play with your friends.\n\nWe are the Poker Queen!",
    "_N$string": "We are committed to creating an online platform for Texas Hold 'em fans \n\nto play and improve their skills at Poker Queen.\n\nWe have various kinds of popular gameplay:\n\nNLH - Classic regular Texas Hold’em.\n\nPLO-From four to six card Pot-limit Omaha Poker game.\n\n6+ Short deck - a whole new poker game.\n\nWe also have a built-in community chat page for social gameplay, \n\nallowing you to chat with other players while playing the game. Poker \n\nQueen brings us closer and invites you to play with your friends.\n\nWe are the Poker Queen!",
